msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B7548105_FE2A_4D76_A3A4_3B24D2F7DAAD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Just thinking about the way he behaved then angers me. ⟪k:1⟫I have little fondness for men "
"who do not treat their spouses with respect."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫その時の、⟪k:1⟫彼の態度といったら。⟪k:2⟫思い出しても、⟪k:3⟫腹が立ちますわ。⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫わたく"
"し、⟪k:6⟫ご自分の伴侶を大切に扱わない殿方は苦手でございます。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1A9784EB_D56B_444A_849F_F27CF5E8805F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88873bb118da06513d3b47a61c721a5ba20bb904e910b2fab6b4395450e6522b
