msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1A9784EB_D56B_444A_849F_F27CF5E8805F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So as you can see, the White-Haired Girl was in hardly a joyous situation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫このように、⟪k:1⟫白い髪の娘は決して幸福とは言えない状況でございました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_93A2F38F_9266_434D_8344_D430730077B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0b7343ea6ceabb0ab6f5bd97e7ecdc578c59c1dfb006491c073d53e66bbbce6
#. default-sha256: 5b7d589c24b816f59a961cd357b557c06521772683d39824d1b03b946ce0d3bc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_93A2F38F_9266_434D_8344_D430730077B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was devoted to Jacopo and tried to do whatever she could for him, but he not only "
"brushed her aside, he did so in an insulting, deliberately hurtful manner."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女は献身的にヤコポに尽くそうといたしましたが、⟪k:1⟫彼はそれを跳ねのけるのみならず、⟪k:2⟫罵"
"倒をもって彼女を傷つけるのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CE2D6955_0DD6_4D3C_B282_B5CC49998B4F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
